प्रमादालस्यनिद्राभिस्तन्निबध्‍नाति भारत ॥ ८ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3871,\"bb\":3407,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/14/8/b3407/\",\"body_value\":\"tamas tv ajñāna-jaṁ viddhi
mohanaṁ sarva-dehinām
